  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enabling Fund - Trial Year - Equalities Programming in Algeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this fund is to provide small pots of funding (&#xa3;10-30k) to UK Posts to deliver new activity around gender and equalities which aims to enable or mobilise engagement on this topic. The purpose this project is to allow between 8-10 members of the LGBT+ activist community to participate in English Language lessons either virtually or in person.</narrative>
  </description>
